 "notes": [
  "The recruitment's opening on black: a line of light shoots across from the left (frames 4-8) over the company's logo in gold, a curtain of light floods the picture -- green on the left and sea blue on the right, then yellow-green to white, then gold under a darkening top -- with six rarity emblems on the line, and dies away (frames 8-48); then the logo in grey with the six emblems in white (frames 49-67).",
  "Measured on the reference in pixels and written in the picture's units (half its height = 1): the emblems 82 px apart round the middle, the logo 590 px wide just above it, the contour triangle 640 px across.",
  "Measured on the reference (display values): the curtain holds to frame 48, a fifth darker by then, and the picture cuts to black on 49 with the grey logo and the six white emblems already there; the logo fades out from 61 to black by 67 and the emblems blink out on 65, back on 66 at four fifths and out on 67."
